    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "探索本課程一系列基於統計模型與演算法的機器學習方法，包括迴歸、分類樹、樸素貝氏與隨機森林。",
      "describe_en": "To explore a range of model based and algorithmic machine learning methods including regression, classification trees, Naive Bayes, and random forests."
